   "ruling": "Ruling: representation; i1040sd p. 15: \"Complete this worksheet only if line 18 or line 19 of Schedule D is more than zero and lines 15 and 16 of Schedule D are gains or if you file Form 4952 and you have an amount on line 4g,\" with the Exception for a zero-or-less line 15 or 16 and no qualified dividends. As the earlier ruling: the project's gate is the trigger shared by both capital gain worksheets and the candidate makes it exclusive of the Schedule D Tax Worksheet, so on completed returns with that worksheet in force it answers false where the project answers true (every sampled value witness has f1040.gate.sdtw true); line 16 takes sdtw.line47 first, so no tax changes. Triage executable-triage-v2 (.transcription/triage/2025/f1040.json, 2026-11-23): 2,702 of 3,510 agree; completed returns: 22 value (that pattern), 332 candidate-unknown, 2 candidate-refuses. Project stands.",
