   "ruling": "Ruling: model error — i1040gi p. 24 line 1e applies to taxable dependent-care benefits; without benefits, Form 2441 Part III is not completed. The candidate always reads f2441.line26, introducing unrelated student/disabled and income prerequisites. Triage has 6 completed candidate-refuses and 88 completed candidate-unknown records; incomplete/refused value differences are inactive Part III values where the project correctly emits zero, not supported benefit calculations. Evidence: triage/f1040.json, executable-triage-v2, 2240 comparisons, 793 agreements; differences by return state {\"completed\": {\"candidate-refuses\": 6, \"candidate-unknown\": 88}, \"incomplete\": {\"candidate-refuses\": 5, \"candidate-unknown\": 733, \"value\": 8}, \"refused\": {\"candidate-refuses\": 263, \"candidate-unknown\": 341, \"value\": 3}}. Sample witnesses: {\"id\": \"classm.s3.3.deepseek\", \"kind\": \"fixture\"}, {\"id\": \"classm.f5695.8.deepseek\", \"kind\": \"fixture\"}. (carried over from reviews/2025/transcription/f1040.index.json at 870cc146, review of 2026-11-01)",
