   "ruling": "Ruling: model error; as the earlier ruling: the printed line 6c is the lump-sum election (i1040gi p. 31); with zero benefits there is no election to make, so the project also requires ssb.line1 above zero and does not ask the election. The candidate reads the election alone, needing an unasked answer. Triage executable-triage-v2 (2026-11-23): 2,775 of 3,510 agree; completed returns: 329 candidate-unknown, no value difference. Project stands.",
